DATA = 'Coulomb magnitude|F=ke*abs(q1*q2)/r^2|F,q1,q2,r|sss+|Magnitude; use signs to decide attract/repel.|P:r^2,-ke*abs(q1*q2);E:;E:;P:F,0,-ke*abs(q1*q2)\nPoint charge field|Ef=ke*q/r^2|Ef,q,r|ss+|Signed outward radial component.|P:r^2,-ke*q;P:-ke,Ef*r^2;P:Ef,0,-ke*q\nElectric force|F=q*Ef|F,q,Ef|sss|Same-axis signed components.|P:1,-Ef*q;P:-Ef,F;P:-q,F\nUniform electric flux|flux=Ef*A*cos(th)|flux,Ef,A,th|ss+s|th between E and outward area normal.|P:1,-A*Ef*cos(th);P:-A*cos(th),flux;P:-Ef*cos(th),flux;E:\nGauss law|flux=q/eps0|flux,q|ss|q is enclosed NET charge; closed surface.|P:eps0,-q;P:-1,eps0*flux\nInfinite line field|Ef=lam/(2*pi*eps0*r)|Ef,lam,r|ss+|Signed radial; infinite uniform line.|P:2*pi*eps0*r,-lam;P:-1,2*pi*Ef*eps0*r;P:2*pi*Ef*eps0,-lam\nInfinite sheet field|Ef=sig/(2*eps0)|Ef,sig|ss|Nonconducting infinite isolated sheet; one side.|P:2*eps0,-sig;P:-1,2*Ef*eps0\nConductor surface|Ef=sig/eps0|Ef,sig|ss|Just outside electrostatic conductor; outward.|P:eps0,-sig;P:-1,Ef*eps0\nUniform sphere inside|Ef=ke*Q*r/R^3|Ef,Q,r,R|ss++|Only 0<r<=R; uniform volume charge.|P:R^3,-Q*ke*r;P:-ke*r,Ef*R^3;P:-Q*ke,Ef*R^3;E:ke^(1/3)*(Q*r/Ef)^(1/3)\nUniform cylinder inside|Ef=rhoq*r/(2*eps0)|Ef,rhoq,r|ss+|Infinite uniform volume cylinder; r inside.|P:2*eps0,-r*rhoq;P:-r,2*Ef*eps0;P:-rhoq,2*Ef*eps0\nRing axis field|Ef=ke*Q*x/(x^2+R^2)^(3/2)|Ef,Q,x,R|sss+|Uniform ring; x along axis from center.|P:R^2*sqrt(R^2 + x^2) + x^2*sqrt(R^2 + x^2),-Q*ke*x;P:-ke*x,Ef*R^2*sqrt(R^2 + x^2) + Ef*x^2*sqrt(R^2 + x^2);E:;E:-sqrt(ke^(2/3)*abs(Q)^(2/3)*abs(x)^(2/3)/abs(Ef)^(2/3) - x^2),sqrt(ke^(2/3)*abs(Q)^(2/3)*abs(x)^(2/3)/abs(Ef)^(2/3) - x^2)\nDisk axis field|Ef=sig/(2*eps0)*(1-x/sqrt(x^2+R^2))|Ef,sig,x,R|sss+|Uniform disk; x>=0 on positive axis.|P:2*eps0*sqrt(R^2 + x^2),sig*x - sig*sqrt(R^2 + x^2);P:x - sqrt(R^2 + x^2),2*Ef*eps0*sqrt(R^2 + x^2);E:;E:\nCharge quantization|Q=nc*qe|Q,nc|ss|nc is signed integer count of elementary charges.|P:1,-nc*qe;P:-qe,Q\nUniform sphere charge|Q=rhoq*4*pi*R^3/3|Q,rhoq,R|ss+|Uniform volume charge density.|P:3,-4*pi*R^3*rhoq;P:-4*pi*R^3,3*Q;E:(1/2)*6^(1/3)*(Q/rhoq)^(1/3)/pi^(1/3)'
